        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1601109",
      "subQuestName": "Confront the Bloodstained Knight",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "160110901"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "160110901": {
            "id": "160110901",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "\"Roland\"",
            "text": "...I shall do as you wish, Knight of Boreas.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "160110902"
            ]
          },
          "160110902": {
            "id": "160110902",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Varka",
            "text": "Huh... You're not quite how I imagined you. You don't seem half as crazed as the memories contained in the Wolf Spirit.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "160110903"
            ]
          },
          "160110903": {
            "id": "160110903",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "\"Roland\"",
            "text": "Not once have I strayed from the righteous path. But when I look at you... I do not see a hero capable of slaying dragons. Just a lost soul who has wandered far too long. A shadow of the knight you once were.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "160110904"
            ]
          },
          "160110904": {
            "id": "160110904",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Varka",
            "text": "I guess we have that much in common. Neither of us is at our peak.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "160110905"
            ]
          },
          "160110905": {
            "id": "160110905",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "\"Roland\"",
            "text": "The Rächer of Solnari's forces have been defeated, and the Roland you see is but an imperfect image cast by the Abyss.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "160110906"
            ]
          },
          "160110906": {
            "id": "160110906",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "\"Roland\"",
            "text": "I wield the power that Roland did at his peak, but my heart and mind remain frozen in that bloodstained moment.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "160110907"
            ]
          },
          "160110907": {
            "id": "160110907",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "\"Roland\"",
            "text": "Therefore, I, in my current form, am flawed... A knight cannot bear their own stagnation.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "160110908"
            ]
          },
          "160110908": {
            "id": "160110908",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "\"Roland\"",
            "text": "After redeeming you from injustice and guiding your surrender to the Abyss, I shall rectify myself and continue to follow the knightly path.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "160110909"
            ]
          },
          "160110909": {
            "id": "160110909",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Varka",
            "text": "Hah! The world out there can bear no more of your torment. Your obsession, clearly, remains exactly as I had imagined. I suppose there's no chance to make you see the light?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "160110910"
            ]
          },
          "160110910": {
            "id": "160110910",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "\"Roland\"",
            "text": "No words can make a knight doubt his convictions, no matter how noble they may sound. Neither of us will sway the other... but you have long known this truth.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "160110911"
            ]
          },
          "160110911": {
            "id": "160110911",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "\"Roland\"",
            "text": "Otherwise, why would you pin all your hopes on Boreas's single thought?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "160110912"
            ]
          },
          "160110912": {
            "id": "160110912",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "\"Roland\"",
            "text": "But now the blade that once housed the Wolf Spirit has been shattered, and all you hold is a phantom that bears its form.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "160110913"
            ]
          },
          "160110913": {
            "id": "160110913",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "\"Roland\"",
            "text": "You no longer have the means to change the situation, and no one will come to your rescue... This place shall be your graveyard, lonely warrior.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "160110914"
            ]
          },
          "160110914": {
            "id": "160110914",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Varka",
            "text": "Eh, maybe you're partly right... But I think I might just have a shot at a rescue.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "160110915"
            ]
          },
          "160110915": {
            "id": "160110915",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "\"Roland\"",
            "text": "...What do you mean?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "160110916"
            ]
          },
          "160110916": {
            "id": "160110916",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Varka",
            "text": "There's only one person's mind I need to change, and it isn't yours...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "160110917"
            ]
          },
          "160110917": {
            "id": "160110917",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Varka",
            "text": "Forgetting where we are? This is the heart of Andrius — God of the North Wind.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "160110918"
            ]
          },
          "160110918": {
            "id": "160110918",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Andrius",
            "text": "...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "160110919"
            ]
          },
          "160110919": {
            "id": "160110919",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Varka",
            "text": "Andrius! Can you hear me?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "160110920"
            ]
          },
          "160110920": {
            "id": "160110920",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Varka",
            "text": "Wake up! You are the great God of the North Wind! How long will you allow yourself to suffer the domination of the Abyss?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "160110921"
            ]
          },
          "160110921": {
            "id": "160110921",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Andrius",
            "text": "...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "160110922"
            ]
          },
          "160110922": {
            "id": "160110922",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "\"Roland\"",
            "text": "...If this is your final gambit, I am most disappointed, Knight of Boreas.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "160110923"
            ]
          },
          "160110923": {
            "id": "160110923",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "\"Roland\"",
            "text": "Grand displays of heartfelt wishes cannot summon miracles. This world shows no such mercy to its inhabitants.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "160110924"
            ]
          },
          "160110924": {
            "id": "160110924",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Andrius",
            "text": "...Return...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "160110925"
            ]
          },
          "160110925": {
            "id": "160110925",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Andrius",
            "text": "...Return to... the Ley Lines...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "160110926"
            ]
          },
          "160110926": {
            "id": "160110926",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "\"Roland\"",
            "text": "...!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "160110927"
            ]
          },
          "160110927": {
            "id": "160110927",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Andrius",
            "text": "...This is my choice... my memory...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "160110928"
            ]
          },
          "160110928": {
            "id": "160110928",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Andrius",
            "text": "...Is this the answer that I found... at my journey's end?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "160110929"
            ]
          },
          "160110929": {
            "id": "160110929",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Varka",
            "text": "And{RUBY#[D]Boreas}rius... At long last, I have delivered your token back into your heart.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "160110930"
            ]
          },
          "160110930": {
            "id": "160110930",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Andrius",
            "text": "Heh... A Knight of Boreas? Watch on...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "160110931"
            ]
          },
          "160110931": {
            "id": "160110931",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Andrius",
            "text": "...This is all that a wo{RUBY#[S]I}lf can hope to do for human{RUBY#[S]you}kind...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "160110932"
            ]
          },
          "160110932": {
            "id": "160110932",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Varka",
            "text": "...On behalf of all humanity, I thank you, Lord of Wolves.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "160110933"
            ]
          },
          "160110933": {
            "id": "160110933",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "\"Roland\"",
            "text": "Boreas... is returning to the Ley Lines? But why? Your sword is broken — you no longer have the means to bear his soul... Unless... Surely not...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "160110934"
            ]
          },
          "160110934": {
            "id": "160110934",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Varka",
            "text": "Begging for miracles is a futile endeavor. I know better than that.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "160110935"
            ]
          },
          "160110935": {
            "id": "160110935",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Varka",
            "text": "...But a sword is just one kind of vessel. There are other ways to store a soul.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "160110936"
            ]
          },
          "160110936": {
            "id": "160110936",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Venti",
            "text": "The Dominator of Wolves once bestowed the power of his soul upon his pack, strengthening their hearts and sharpening their claws and fangs.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "160110937"
            ]
          },
          "160110937": {
            "id": "160110937",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Boreas",
            "text": "...Even if it is not my intention, the soul of Lupus Boreas will inevitably ravage, devour, and assimilate a mortal heart... As if human and wolf were being forcefully merged into one being.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "160110938"
            ]
          },
          "160110938": {
            "id": "160110938",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "\"The Captain\"",
            "text": "...If a mortal heart is to bear the soul of a god... This is a path that cannot be retraced. Yet I shall not dissuade a knight from embarking on the quest of his own choosing.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "160110939"
            ]
          },
          "160110939": {
            "id": "160110939",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "\"Roland\"",
            "text": "Your heart, your soul... they are collapsing? ...Ah, now I see.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "160110940"
            ]
          },
          "160110940": {
            "id": "160110940",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Varka",
            "text": "You were wondering how a lamb could tame the heart of a wolf... isn't that right?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "160110941"
            ]
          },
          "160110941": {
            "id": "160110941",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Varka",
            "text": "Here's my answer: You get the wolf to swallow the heart.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "160110942"
            ]
          },
          "160110942": {
            "id": "160110942",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "\"Roland\"",
            "text": "The Wolf Spirit within the sword was merely a decoy... the true thoughts and memories were carried within your heart.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "160110943"
            ]
          },
          "160110943": {
            "id": "160110943",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "\"Roland\"",
            "text": "To avoid arousing my suspicion, you deliberately allowed Lupus Boreas's soul to assimilate your own, then be devoured by me... But... how did you have the strength to fight while bearing such a great burden...?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "160110944"
            ]
          },
          "160110944": {
            "id": "160110944",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Varka",
            "text": "Compared to Lupus Boreas's decision... my sacrifice is nothing.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "160110945"
            ]
          },
          "160110945": {
            "id": "160110945",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "\"Roland\"",
            "text": "You have a stubborn will and employed an exceptional strategy... but this is not the way a true knight fights. The choice you have made is a flawed one.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "160110946"
            ]
          },
          "160110946": {
            "id": "160110946",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "\"Roland\"",
            "text": "Your soul is now merged with that of Andrius. When he fully joins the Ley Lines, you too will fall.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "160110947"
            ]
          },
          "160110947": {
            "id": "160110947",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "\"Roland\"",
            "text": "Neither Barbatos nor the Traveler will be able to anchor your soul from within the Ley Lines, let alone rescue you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "160110948"
            ]
          },
          "160110948": {
            "id": "160110948",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "\"Roland\"",
            "text": "You have lost, and so have I. Regrettably, I can no longer offer you salvation.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "160110949"
            ]
          },
          "160110949": {
            "id": "160110949",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "\"Roland\"",
            "text": "...May your soul rest in peace with Boreas, lonely warrior.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "160110950"
            ]
          },
          "160110950": {
            "id": "160110950",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Varka",
            "text": "...Haha, lonely...?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "160110951"
            ]
          },
          "160110951": {
            "id": "160110951",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Varka",
            "text": "Sorry to disappoint you, but... As much as it sounded like the perfect ending, for both of us to return to the Ley Lines together...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "160110952"
            ]
          },
          "160110952": {
            "id": "160110952",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Varka",
            "text": "The fact is that — unlike the true Roland of the past — I still have fine wine and good friends to get back to. They're looking forward to my triumphant return...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "160110953"
            ]
          },
          "160110953": {
            "id": "160110953",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Varka",
            "text": "So I'm not ready to accept my fate just yet!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "160110954"
            ]
          },
          "160110954": {
            "id": "160110954",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Venti",
            "text": "Ding-dong! You've got mail!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1601110",
      "subQuestName": "Fight your way out of the Ley Lines",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1601111",
      "subQuestName": "Triumphant Return",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "160111101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "160111101": {
            "id": "160111101",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Varka",
            "text": "...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "160111102"
            ]
          },
          "160111102": {
            "id": "160111102",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Andrius",
            "text": "...Walk forward, and do not look back.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "160111103"
            ]
          },
          "160111103": {
            "id": "160111103",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Razor",
            "text": "\"Varka... Now, I know the meaning of my name.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "160111104"
            ]
          },
          "160111104": {
            "id": "160111104",
            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "Rosaria",
            "text": "\"...After the lengths you've made everyone go for you, you'd better make sure to thank us all properly when you get back.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "160111105"
            ]
          },
          "160111105": {
            "id": "160111105",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "Kaeya",
            "text": "\"You know, I have a lot of things to update you on... but they can wait until you're back.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "160111106"
            ]
          },
          "160111106": {
            "id": "160111106",
            "speakerId": 1009,
            "speakerName": "Diluc",
            "text": "\"I have no intention of returning to the Knights of Favonius... But I trust you will find a way to manage on your own.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "160111107"
            ]
          },
          "160111107": {
            "id": "160111107",
            "speakerId": 1010,
            "speakerName": "Jean",
            "text": "\"...Grand Master, we're all waiting for you.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "160111108"
            ]
          },
          "160111108": {
            "id": "160111108",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Varka",
            "text": "...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "160111109"
            ]
          },
          "160111109": {
            "id": "160111109",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Varka",
            "text": "Hmm? ...Oh. Heh.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "160111110"
            ]
          },
          "160111110": {
            "id": "160111110",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Varka",
            "text": "I'm... not doing too bad a job as Grand Master, am I?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "160111111"
            ]
          },
          "160111111": {
            "id": "160111111",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Varka",
            "text": "Heh... I'll take that silence as your approval.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "160111112"
            ]
          },
          "160111112": {
            "id": "160111112",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Varka",
            "text": "Everything you swore to protect with your lives... It's all still here, safe and sound.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "160111113"
            ]
          },
          "160111113": {
            "id": "160111113",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Varka",
            "text": "The Knights of Favonius, Mondstadt... and the oath sworn by every knight. I'll protect them all with my life.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "160111114"
            ]
          },
          "160111114": {
            "id": "160111114",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Varka",
            "text": "And so... I'll deliver that letter on your behalf.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "160111115"
            ]
          },
          "160111115": {
            "id": "160111115",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Varka",
            "text": "...I know it's just a shadow of the real Roland, but... if you have the time, could you please read it for him?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "160111116"
            ]
          },
          "160111116": {
            "id": "160111116",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Varka",
            "text": "Rostam and Arundolyn... They never forgot you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "160111117"
            ]
          },
          "160111117": {
            "id": "160111117",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Varka",
            "text": "Phew... This has been one long expedition.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "160111118"
            ]
          },
          "160111118": {
            "id": "160111118",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Varka",
            "text": "From here on out, I think I'll...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "160111119"
            ]
          },
          "160111119": {
            "id": "160111119",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Varka",
            "text": "...Let the wind lead.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "160111122"
            ]
          },
          "160111122": {
            "id": "160111122",
            "speakerId": 1011,
            "speakerName": "Knights",
            "text": "...!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "160111130"
            ]
          },
          "160111130": {
            "id": "160111130",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Varka",
            "text": "...Hey, everyone. It's been a mighty long time.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "160111131"
            ]
          },
          "160111131": {
            "id": "160111131",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Varka",
            "text": "I'm... thrilled to see you all again.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "160111132"
            ]
          },
          "160111132": {
            "id": "160111132",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Welcome back, Grand Master.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "160111133"
            ]
          },
          "160111133": {
            "id": "160111133",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Varka",
            "text": "Yeah. I'm home.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "160111123"
            ]
          },
          "160111123": {
            "id": "160111123",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Varka",
            "text": "...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "160111124"
            ]
          },
          "160111124": {
            "id": "160111124",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Varka",
            "text": "...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "160111125"
            ]
          },
          "160111125": {
            "id": "160111125",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Varka",
            "text": "...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "160111126"
            ]
          },
          "160111126": {
            "id": "160111126",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Varka",
            "text": "..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1601112",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Varka",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "160111201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "160111201": {
            "id": "160111201",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Varka",
            "text": "Ahhh... It's been a while since I felt this wind on my face... Just how I remember. So, is there anything you'd like to talk about? Now's your chance, before I get dragged off to the office...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "160111203",
              "160111216",
              "160111220",
              "160111232"
            ]
          },
          "160111203": {
            "id": "160111203",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Varka",
            "text": "The sword was just a decoy — I carried his soul in my own heart... That was the plan I was most certain would work.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "160111204"
            ]
          },
          "160111204": {
            "id": "160111204",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Varka",
            "text": "The second half, though — using everyone's thoughts to guide me back out of the Ley Lines... I wasn't too sure that would work out, hah.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "160111205"
            ]
          },
          "160111205": {
            "id": "160111205",
            "speakerId": 1012,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#All jokes aside, what would you have done if {NICKNAME} hadn't been able to separate the Wolf Spirit from Roland's influence?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "160111206"
            ]
          },
          "160111206": {
            "id": "160111206",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Varka",
            "text": "Hmm... Initially, I was planning to have Barbatos carry out that step. But when I approached him about it, he said there was a much more suitable candidate... The Outlander Who Caught the Wind.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "160111207"
            ]
          },
          "160111207": {
            "id": "160111207",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Varka",
            "text": "#Turns out our trust was not misplaced. Thank you, {NICKNAME}.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "160111208"
            ]
          },
          "160111208": {
            "id": "160111208",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "But what if I'd failed?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "160111209"
            ]
          },
          "160111209": {
            "id": "160111209",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Varka",
            "text": "Then... I guess we'd have had to get Barbatos to send a wind to blow me back home?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "160111210"
            ]
          },
          "160111210": {
            "id": "160111210",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Varka",
            "text": "...But it would have come at a heavy price, and with no guarantee of success. Besides, I'd rather not have him expend that kind of power."
          },
          "160111216": {
            "id": "160111216",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Varka",
            "text": "Well, with the shadow of Roland vanquished, the Wild Hunt won't be able to consolidate their forces for the foreseeable future.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "160111217"
            ]
          },
          "160111217": {
            "id": "160111217",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Varka",
            "text": "A few knights will remain on rotation at the Nod-Krai stronghold, but everyone else will be sent home in waves.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "160111218"
            ]
          },
          "160111218": {
            "id": "160111218",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Varka",
            "text": "Albedo and Durin will come back with the first wave, so you should have the chance to see them again soon."
          },
          "160111220": {
            "id": "160111220",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Varka",
            "text": "My future, huh... You may already have learned of this from Barbatos or the Hexenzirkel, but I glimpsed a reflection of the future in Barbeloth's scryglass.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "160111221"
            ]
          },
          "160111221": {
            "id": "160111221",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "You saw an Abyssal calamity in the North, right?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "160111222"
            ]
          },
          "160111222": {
            "id": "160111222",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Varka",
            "text": "Correct. Although, as things stand now... I believe we may have changed the course of the future — thanks in no small part to you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "160111223"
            ]
          },
          "160111223": {
            "id": "160111223",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Varka",
            "text": "Still, after I've tied up some loose ends with the Knights of Favonius, I'll need to make another trip back north... There's still a lot of work to be done at the Nod-Krai stronghold.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "160111224"
            ]
          },
          "160111224": {
            "id": "160111224",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Varka",
            "text": "Besides, the first group of knights who volunteered to stay there have yet to be relieved of their duty. How could I simply abandon them?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "160111225"
            ]
          },
          "160111225": {
            "id": "160111225",
            "speakerId": 1012,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Aw, how noble... But be honest, your main reason for going back to Nod-Krai is so you can dump all your work here on Jean again, isn't it?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "160111226"
            ]
          },
          "160111226": {
            "id": "160111226",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Varka",
            "text": "...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "160111227"
            ]
          },
          "160111227": {
            "id": "160111227",
            "speakerId": 1012,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "...Wait, seriously!?"
          },
          "160111232": {
            "id": "160111232",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Varka",
            "text": "Alright then. I'm gonna stay here and enjoy the breeze for a little longer... For all the wine in the world, there's no feeling as intoxicating as the wind from your hometown after a long time away."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1601199",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "160119906"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "160119906": {
            "id": "160119906",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "\"Roland\"",
            "text": "...No matter the epoch, the world is awash with corruption and injustice.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "160119907"
            ]
          },
          "160119907": {
            "id": "160119907",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "\"Roland\"",
            "text": "Even the most fearless hero cannot fight what fa{RUBY#[S]death}te has ordained.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "160119908"
            ]
          },
          "160119908": {
            "id": "160119908",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "\"Roland\"",
            "text": "And even the holiest god cannot escape the shac{RUBY#[S]love}kles that bind them.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "160119909"
            ]
          },
          "160119909": {
            "id": "160119909",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "\"Roland\"",
            "text": "Lupus Boreas, if you still harbor love for humanity, then you must surely know...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "160119910"
            ]
          },
          "160119910": {
            "id": "160119910",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "\"Roland\"",
            "text": "There has only ever been one way to save them from injustice.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "160119911"
            ]
          },
          "160119911": {
            "id": "160119911",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Andrius",
            "text": "...Surrender to... the Abyss..."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}